# 13. One concept that will save you a lot of confusion

Separate these four things:

### Model

**What is doing the generation?**

```text
GPT
Claude
Gemini
Llama
Mistral
DeepSeek
Qwen
```

### API

**How do I talk to it?**

```text
OpenAI API
Anthropic API
Gemini API
```

### Hosting/inference platform

**Where/how is the model being served?**

```text
AWS Bedrock
Azure
Google Cloud
Groq
Together
self-hosted
```

### Application framework

**How does my application orchestrate it?**

```text
LangChain
LlamaIndex
Semantic Kernel
custom Python/Java/TypeScript
```

These are different layers.

